# Normalize text files to LF in the repository. Prettier's endOfLine:"auto"
# tolerates whatever the working tree has after an autocrlf checkout, so this
# does not force a re-checkout of existing files.
* text=auto

# Binary assets — never touch line endings or attempt diffs.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
